---
// Testimonials component
---

<section
  id="testimonials"
  class="bg-background py-28 lg:py-40 border-b border-hairline overflow-hidden scroll-mt-[90px]"
>
  <div class="shell">
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="reveal mb-16">
      <div class="about-eyebrow-light mb-6">Trusted through the work</div>
      <h2
        class="font-display font-light leading-[1.15]"
        style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); color: #0d1b16;"
      >
        The work speaks louder<br />than the introduction.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <!-- Testimonials Grid -->
    <div
      class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 xl:gap-10 reveal"
    >
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div
        class="clay-testimonial-card relative flex flex-col p-10 lg:p-12 rounded-[2.5rem] bg-background"
      >
        <!-- Quote Icon -->
        <div class="mb-8 text-[#9fa19a] opacity-50">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"
            ><path
              d="M14.017 21v-7.391c0-5.704 3.731-9.57 8.983-10.609l.995 2.151c-2.432.917-3.995 3.638-3.995 5.849h4v10h-9.983zm-14.017 0v-7.391c0-5.704 3.748-9.57 9-10.609l.996 2.151c-2.433.917-3.996 3.638-3.996 5.849h4v10h-10z"
            ></path></svg
          >
        </div>

        <!-- Quote -->
        <p
          class="flex-grow font-serif text-[1.1rem] md:text-[1.15rem] leading-relaxed text-[#4a4d46] mb-10"
        >
          "The transition was flawless. Calveris didn't just take over our
          ledger; they re-engineered our entire month-end close to operate at a
          fraction of the time."
        </p>

        <!-- Divider -->
        <div class="w-full h-px bg-black/5 mb-8"></div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="flex items-center gap-5">
          <div
            class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full clay-inset flex items-center justify-center font-display text-lg text-[#2a5a4a] shrink-0"
          >
            S
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
            <span
              class="text-[9px] font-bold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-[#0d1b16]"
              >Managing Director</span
            >
            <span
              class="text-[9px] font-medium tracking-[0.1em] uppercase text-[#8a8c86]"
              >Series B Fintech</span
            >
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div
        class="clay-testimonial-card relative flex flex-col p-10 lg:p-12 rounded-[2.5rem] bg-background"
      >
        <div class="mb-8 text-[#9fa19a] opacity-50">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"
            ><path
              d="M14.017 21v-7.391c0-5.704 3.731-9.57 8.983-10.609l.995 2.151c-2.432.917-3.995 3.638-3.995 5.849h4v10h-9.983zm-14.017 0v-7.391c0-5.704 3.748-9.57 9-10.609l.996 2.151c-2.433.917-3.996 3.638-3.996 5.849h4v10h-10z"
            ></path></svg
          >
        </div>
        <p
          class="flex-grow font-serif text-[1.1rem] md:text-[1.15rem] leading-relaxed text-[#4a4d46] mb-10"
        >
          "Having a dedicated fractional controller pod without the overhead of
          internal hiring has fundamentally accelerated our international
          expansion."
        </p>
        <div class="w-full h-px bg-black/5 mb-8"></div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-5">
          <div
            class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full clay-inset flex items-center justify-center font-display text-lg text-[#2a5a4a] shrink-0"
          >
            G
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
            <span
              class="text-[9px] font-bold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-[#0d1b16]"
              >Founder & CEO</span
            >
            <span
              class="text-[9px] font-medium tracking-[0.1em] uppercase text-[#8a8c86]"
              >Global Retail Brand</span
            >
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div
        class="clay-testimonial-card relative flex flex-col p-10 lg:p-12 rounded-[2.5rem] bg-background"
      >
        <div class="mb-8 text-[#9fa19a] opacity-50">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"
            ><path
              d="M14.017 21v-7.391c0-5.704 3.731-9.57 8.983-10.609l.995 2.151c-2.432.917-3.995 3.638-3.995 5.849h4v10h-9.983zm-14.017 0v-7.391c0-5.704 3.748-9.57 9-10.609l.996 2.151c-2.433.917-3.996 3.638-3.996 5.849h4v10h-10z"
            ></path></svg
          >
        </div>
        <p
          class="flex-grow font-serif text-[1.1rem] md:text-[1.15rem] leading-relaxed text-[#4a4d46] mb-10"
        >
          "Discreet, highly capable, and immediately impactful. The Calveris OS
          provides unprecedented visibility into our portfolio's financial
          operations."
        </p>
        <div class="w-full h-px bg-black/5 mb-8"></div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-5">
          <div
            class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full clay-inset flex items-center justify-center font-display text-lg text-[#2a5a4a] shrink-0"
          >
            L
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
            <span
              class="text-[9px] font-bold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-[#0d1b16]"
              >Managing Partner</span
            >
            <span
              class="text-[9px] font-medium tracking-[0.1em] uppercase text-[#8a8c86]"
              >London Venture Capital</span
            >
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* Section Eyebrow */
  .about-eyebrow-light {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 10px 24px;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #7caa78;
    background: rgba(232, 235, 229, 0.4);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    box-shadow:
      inset 4px 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08),
      inset -4px -4px 8px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    width: fit-content;
  }
  .about-eyebrow-light::before {
    content: "";
    display: inline-block;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    transform: rotate(45deg);
    background: #7caa78;
  }

  /* Neumorphic Testimonial Card */
  .clay-testimonial-card {
    box-shadow:
      20px 20px 40px #c4c6cc,
      -20px -20px 40px #ffffff;
    transition:
      transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1),
      box-shadow 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
  }
  .clay-testimonial-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-8px);
    box-shadow:
      25px 25px 50px #c4c6cc,
      -25px -25px 50px #ffffff;
  }

  /* Inset Avatar */
  .clay-inset {
    box-shadow:
      inset 4px 4px 8px #c4c6cc,
      inset -4px -4px 8px #ffffff;
  }
</style>
